        "original_id": "eac5b6a5-dbfd-57bd-93ac-fa8365b01967",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Gary Gordon, Randy Shughart\n- Organizations: United States Army, 1st Special Forces Operational Detachment-Delta, Delta Force\n- Events: Battle of Mogadishu\n- Awards: Medal of Honor\n\nFacts:\n- Randy Shughart was born on August 13, 1958.\n- Randy Shughart served as a United States Army soldier in 1st Special Forces Operational Detachment-Delta, also known as Delta Force.\n- Randy Shughart died on October 3, 1993.\n- In October 1993, Gary Gordon performed actions during the Battle of Mogadishu alongside Sergeant First Class Randy Shughart.\n- Gary Gordon and Randy Shughart were posthumously awarded the Medal of Honor for their actions during the Battle of Mogadishu.",
